e-trigger \">\n              <div class=\"col-4 column\">\n      <p class=\"key table-cell\"><span class=\"toggle-arrow\"><svg width=\"6\" height=\"9\" viewBox=\"0 0 6 9\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M4.7294 4.45711L0.733399 7.82311L1.1294 8.29111L5.6654 4.45711L1.1294 0.641113L0.751398 1.12711L4.7294 4.45711Z\" fill=\"black\"/></svg></span> attributes</p>\n    </div>\n              <div class=\"col-2 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">object</p></div>\n              <div class=\"col-6 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">Attributes for a Container Image.</p></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"row isNested d-none  \">\n          <div class=\"col-12 first-column\">\n            <div data-parent-field=\"attributes\" class=\"row table-row first-row  \">\n              <div class=\"col-4 column\">\n      <p class=\"key table-cell\">container_count</p>\n    </div>\n              <div class=\"col-2 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">int64</p></div>\n              <div class=\"col-6 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">Number of containers running the image.</p></div>\n            </div>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div><div class=\"row isNested d-none hasChildData \">\n          <div class=\"col-12 first-column\">\n            <div data-parent-field=\"attributes\" class=\"row table-row first-row js-collapse-trigger collapse-trigger \">\n              <div class=\"col-4 column\">\n      <p class=\"key table-cell\"><span class=\"toggle-arrow\"><svg width=\"6\" height=\"9\" viewBox=\"0 0 6 9\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M4.7294 4.45711L0.733399 7.82311L1.1294 8.29111L5.6654 4.45711L1.1294 0.641113L0.751398 1.12711L4.7294 4.45711Z\" fill=\"black\"/></svg></span> image_flavors</p>\n    </div>\n              <div class=\"col-2 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">[object]</p></div>\n              <div class=\"col-6 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">Platform-specific image metadata, including size in bytes and available build and operating\nsystem details. Use these objects to associate sizes with platforms when platform information is available.</p></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"row isNested d-none  \">\n          <div class=\"col-12 first-column\">\n            <div data-parent-field=\"image_flavors\" class=\"row table-row first-row  \">\n              <div class=\"col-4 column\">\n      <p class=\"key table-cell\">built_at</p>\n    </div>\n              <div class=\"col-2 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">string</p></div>\n              <div class=\"col-6 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">Time the platform-specific Container Image was built.</p></div>\n            </div>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div><div class=\"row isNested d-none  \">\n          <div class=\"col-12 first-column\">\n            <div data-parent-field=\"image_flavors\" class=\"row table-row first-row  \">\n              <div class=\"col-4 column\">\n      <p class=\"key table-cell\">os_architecture</p>\n    </div>\n              <div class=\"col-2 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">string</p></div>\n              <div class=\"col-6 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">Operating System architecture supported by the Container Image.</p></div>\n            </div>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div><div class=\"row isNested d-none  \">\n          <div class=\"col-12 first-column\">\n            <div data-parent-field=\"image_flavors\" class=\"row table-row first-row  \">\n              <div class=\"col-4 column\">\n      <p class=\"key table-cell\">os_name</p>\n    </div>\n              <div class=\"col-2 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">string</p></div>\n              <div class=\"col-6 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">Operating System name supported by the Container Image.</p></div>\n            </div>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div><div class=\"row isNested d-none  \">\n          <div class=\"col-12 first-column\">\n            <div data-parent-field=\"image_flavors\" class=\"row table-row first-row  \">\n              <div class=\"col-4 column\">\n      <p class=\"key table-cell\">os_version</p>\n    </div>\n              <div class=\"col-2 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">string</p></div>\n              <div class=\"col-6 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">Operating System version supported by the Container Image.</p></div>\n            </div>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div><div class=\"row isNested d-none  \">\n          <div class=\"col-12 first-column\">\n            <div data-parent-field=\"image_flavors\" class=\"row table-row first-row  \">\n              <div class=\"col-4 column\">\n      <p class=\"key table-cell\">size</p>\n    </div>\n              <div class=\"col-2 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">int64</p></div>\n              <div class=\"col-6 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">Size of the platform-specific Container Image in bytes.</p></div>\n            </div>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div>\n          </div>\n        </div><div class=\"row isNested d-none  \">\n          <div class=\"col-12 first-column\">\n            <div data-parent-field=\"attributes\" class=\"row table-row first-row  \">\n              <div class=\"col-4 column\">\n      <p class=\"key table-cell\">image_tags</p>\n    </div>\n              <div class=\"col-2 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">[string]</p></div>\n              <div class=\"col-6 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">Image version tags, such as <code>latest</code> or <code>v1.2.3</code>. Tags can change; use the returned <code>id</code> to\nidentify an image record. The corresponding filter and grouping key is <code>image_tag</code>.</p></div>\n            </div>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div><div class=\"row isNested d-none  \">\n          <div class=\"col-12 first-column\">\n            <div data-parent-field=\"attributes\" class=\"row table-row first-row  \">\n              <div class=\"col-4 column\">\n      <p class=\"key table-cell\">images_built_at</p>\n    </div>\n              <div class=\"col-2 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">[string]</p></div>\n              <div class=\"col-6 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">List of build times associated with the Container Image.\nThe list contains more than 1 entry for multi-architecture images.</p></div>\n            </div>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div><div class=\"row isNested d-none  \">\n          <div class=\"col-12 first-column\">\n            <div data-parent-field=\"attributes\" class=\"row table-row first-row  \">\n              <div class=\"col-4 column\">\n      <p class=\"key table-cell\">name</p>\n    </div>\n              <div class=\"col-2 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">string</p></div>\n              <div class=\"col-6 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">Name of the Container Image.</p></div>\n            </div>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div><div class=\"row isNested d-none  \">\n          <div class=\"col-12 first-column\">\n            <div data-parent-field=\"attributes\" class=\"row table-row first-row  \">\n              <div class=\"col-4 column\">\n      <p class=\"key table-cell\">os_architectures</p>\n    </div>\n              <div class=\"col-2 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">[string]</p></div>\n              <div class=\"col-6 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">List of Operating System architectures supported by the Container Image.</p></div>\n            </div>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div><div class=\"row isNested d-none  \">\n          <div class=\"col-12 first-column\">\n            <div data-parent-field=\"attributes\" class=\"row table-row first-row  \">\n              <div class=\"col-4 column\">\n      <p class=\"key table-cell\">os_names</p>\n    </div>\n              <div class=\"col-2 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">[string]</p></div>\n              <div class=\"col-6 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">List of Operating System names supported by the Container Image.</p></div>\n            </div>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div><div class=\"row isNested d-none  \">\n          <div class=\"col-12 first-column\">\n            <div data-parent-field=\"attributes\" class=\"row table-row first-row  \">\n              <div class=\"col-4 column\">\n      <p class=\"key table-cell\">os_versions</p>\n    </div>\n              <div class=\"col-2 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">[string]</p></div>\n              <div class=\"col-6 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">List of Operating System versions supported by the Container Image.</p></div>\n            </div>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div><div class=\"row isNested d-none  \">\n          <div class=\"col-12 first-column\">\n            <div data-parent-field=\"attributes\" class=\"row table-row first-row  \">\n              <div class=\"col-4 column\">\n      <p class=\"key table-cell\">published_at</p>\n    </div>\n              <div class=\"col-2 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">string</p></div>\n              <div class=\"col-6 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">Time the image was pushed to the container registry.</p></div>\n            </div>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div><div class=\"row isNested d-none  \">\n          <div class=\"col-12 first-column\">\n            <div data-parent-field=\"attributes\" class=\"row table-row first-row  \">\n              <div class=\"col-4 column\">\n      <p class=\"key table-cell\">registry</p>\n    </div>\n              <div class=\"col-2 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">string</p></div>\n              <div class=\"col-6 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">Registry where the image is stored. Use the <code>image_registry</code> tag key for filtering and grouping.</p></div>\n            </div>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div><div class=\"row isNested d-none  \">\n          <div class=\"col-12 first-column\">\n            <div data-parent-field=\"attributes\" class=\"row table-row first-row  \">\n              <div class=\"col-4 column\">\n      <p class=\"key table-cell\">repo_digest</p>\n    </div>\n              <div class=\"col-2 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">string</p></div>\n              <div class=\"col-6 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">Digest of the compressed image manifest. Use the <code>repo_digest</code> tag key to filter by this value.</p></div>\n            </div>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div><div class=\"row isNested d-none  \">\n          <div class=\"col-12 first-column\">\n            <div data-parent-field=\"attributes\" class=\"row table-row first-row  \">\n              <div class=\"col-4 column\">\n      <p class=\"key table-cell\">repository</p>\n    </div>\n              <div class=\"col-2 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">string</p></div>\n              <div class=\"col-6 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">Repository where the image is stored. Use the <code>image_repository</code> tag key for filtering and grouping.</p></div>\n            </div>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div><div class=\"row isNested d-none  \">\n          <div class=\"col-12 first-column\">\n            <div data-parent-field=\"attributes\" class=\"row table-row first-row  \">\n              <div class=\"col-4 column\">\n      <p class=\"key table-cell\">short_image</p>\n    </div>\n              <div class=\"col-2 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">string</p></div>\n              <div class=\"col-6 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">Short version of the Container Image name.</p></div>\n            </div>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div><div class=\"row isNested d-none  \">\n          <div class=\"col-12 first-column\">\n            <div data-parent-field=\"attributes\" class=\"row table-row first-row  \">\n              <div class=\"col-4 column\">\n      <p class=\"key table-cell\">sizes</p>\n    </div>\n              <div class=\"col-2 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">[integer]</p></div>\n              <div class=\"col-6 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">Reported sizes in bytes of platform-specific images, with multiple values possible for multi-architecture images.\nUse <code>image_flavors</code> for available platform associations; use <code>size</code> as the sort key.</p></div>\n            </div>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div><div class=\"row isNested d-none  \">\n          <div class=\"col-12 first-column\">\n            <div data-parent-field=\"attributes\" class=\"row table-row first-row  \">\n              <div class=\"col-4 column\">\n      <p class=\"key table-cell\">sources</p>\n    </div>\n              <div class=\"col-2 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">[string]</p></div>\n              <div class=\"col-6 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">Collection sources, such as <code>live_containers</code>, <code>image_check</code>, <code>aws_ecr</code>, or <code>agentless_scanner</code>.</p></div>\n            </div>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div><div class=\"row isNested d-none  \">\n          <div class=\"col-12 first-column\">\n            <div data-parent-field=\"attributes\" class=\"row table-row first-row  \">\n              <div class=\"col-4 column\">\n      <p class=\"key table-cell\">tags</p>\n    </div>\n              <div class=\"col-2 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">[string]</p></div>\n              <div class=\"col-6 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">Image tags in <code>key:value</code> form, such as <code>image_registry:docker.io</code> or <code>status:running</code>.\nUse tag keys in <code>group_by</code>. Tags used in <code>filter[tags]</code> must satisfy its syntax restrictions.</p></div>\n            </div>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div><div class=\"row isNested d-none hasChildData \">\n          <div class=\"col-12 first-column\">\n            <div data-parent-field=\"attributes\" class=\"row table-row first-row js-collapse-trigger collapse-trigger \">\n              <div class=\"col-4 column\">\n      <p class=\"key table-cell\"><span class=\"toggle-arrow\"><svg width=\"6\" height=\"9\" viewBox=\"0 0 6 9\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M4.7294 4.45711L0.733399 7.82311L1.1294 8.29111L5.6654 4.45711L1.1294 0.641113L0.751398 1.12711L4.7294 4.45711Z\" fill=\"black\"/></svg></span> vulnerability_count</p>\n    </div>\n              <div class=\"col-2 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">object</p></div>\n              <div class=\"col-6 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">Vulnerability counts by severity, when available. An absent <code>vulnerability_count</code> does not mean\nthe image has no vulnerabilities.</p></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"row isNested d-none  \">\n          <div class=\"col-12 first-column\">\n            <div data-parent-field=\"vulnerability_count\" class=\"row table-row first-row  \">\n              <div class=\"col-4 column\">\n      <p class=\"key table-cell\">asset_id</p>\n    </div>\n              <div class=\"col-2 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">string</p></div>\n              <div class=\"col-6 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">ID of the Container Image.</p></div>\n            </div>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div><div class=\"row isNested d-none  \">\n          <div class=\"col-12 first-column\">\n            <div data-parent-field=\"vulnerability_count\" class=\"row table-row first-row  \">\n              <div class=\"col-4 column\">\n      <p class=\"key table-cell\">critical</p>\n    </div>\n              <div class=\"col-2 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">int64</p></div>\n              <div class=\"col-6 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">Number of vulnerabilities with CVSS Critical severity.</p></div>\n            </div>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div><div class=\"row isNested d-none  \">\n          <div class=\"col-12 first-column\">\n            <div data-parent-field=\"vulnerability_count\" class=\"row table-row first-row  \">\n              <div class=\"col-4 column\">\n      <p class=\"key table-cell\">high</p>\n    </div>\n              <div class=\"col-2 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">int64</p></div>\n              <div class=\"col-6 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">Number of vulnerabilities with CVSS High severity.</p></div>\n            </div>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div><div class=\"row isNested d-none  \">\n          <div class=\"col-12 first-column\">\n            <div data-parent-field=\"vulnerability_count\" class=\"row table-row first-row  \">\n              <div class=\"col-4 column\">\n      <p class=\"key table-cell\">low</p>\n    </div>\n              <div class=\"col-2 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">int64</p></div>\n              <div class=\"col-6 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">Number of vulnerabilities with CVSS Low severity.</p></div>\n            </div>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div><div class=\"row isNested d-none  \">\n          <div class=\"col-12 first-column\">\n            <div data-parent-field=\"vulnerability_count\" class=\"row table-row first-row  \">\n              <div class=\"col-4 column\">\n      <p class=\"key table-cell\">medium</p>\n    </div>\n              <div class=\"col-2 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">int64</p></div>\n              <div class=\"col-6 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">Number of vulnerabilities with CVSS Medium severity.</p></div>\n            </div>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div><div class=\"row isNested d-none  \">\n          <div class=\"col-12 first-column\">\n            <div data-parent-field=\"vulnerability_count\" class=\"row table-row first-row  \">\n              <div class=\"col-4 column\">\n      <p class=\"key table-cell\">none</p>\n    </div>\n              <div class=\"col-2 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">int64</p></div>\n              <div class=\"col-6 column\"><p class=\"table-cell\">Number of vulnerabilities with CVSS None severity